---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="404">
  <div class="nf wrap">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p data-i18n="misc.page404">这一页掉进液态玻璃里了</p>
    <p class="nf-sub" data-lang-zh>你要找的内容不在这里，可能已被移动或从未存在。</p>
    <p class="nf-sub" data-lang-en style="display:none">The page you are looking for has been moved or never existed.</p>
    <p class="nf-btns">
      <a class="g-btn primary" href="/" data-i18n="misc.backHome">回首页</a>
      <a class="g-btn" href="/blog/" data-i18n="misc.toBlog">去逛逛博客</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
